          "reasoning_effort": "unsupported",
          "json_object": "unsupported"
        }
      },
      "field_notes": {
        "temperature": {
          "zh": "仅在 reasoning_effort=none（关闭思考）时生效；默认思考模式下显式传入会被拒绝。",
          "en": "Effective only with reasoning_effort=none. An explicit value is rejected in the default thinking mode."
        },
        "top_p": {
          "zh": "思考模式下低于 0.95 的值映射到 0.95；关闭思考时该字段无效，显式传入会被拒绝。",
          "en": "Values below 0.95 map to 0.95 in thinking mode. An explicit value is rejected when thinking is disabled."
        }
      }
    },
